---
manual: element.edit_box.block
lines: [3017, 3030]
testability: interactive
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  edit_box do |e|
    @counter.text = e.text.size
  end
  @counter = strong("0")
  para @counter, " characters"
end
----------- test code
assert_equal "0 characters", para.text

click_on edit_box
type_text "hi"
assert_equal "2 characters", para.text, "typing into the box runs the block"

press_key :backspace
assert_equal "1 characters", para.text, "and so does deleting"
